809 0 obj
<<
/Title (Harold Cohen asks whether a system that evaluates, decides, and satisfies constraints is, in some limited sense, thinking.  I encountered this question most acutely in my final two projects, both of which transform quantitative data into something that feels inhabited.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 808 0 R
>>
